************Dynamic components******
Components can be added dynamically to DOM .
Steps to add compoenents dynamically:-
1.Define a directive with  constructor(public viewContainerRef: ViewContainerRef) { }.
2. Define a child components template.
3. Define a main component with <ng-template ad-host></ng-template> in templete DOM. Here 'ad-host' is the directive selector.

************************** Directives ***************
There are 3 kinds of directives in angular
1. Component- directives with template
2.Structural directive - changes the DOM layout by adding/removing html
3.Attribute directive:- chnages the appearance or behavoiur of component or directive

Example of attribute directive
